{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:55:12+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T15:55:12+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"flatexDEGIRO SE","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Capital Markets","country":"Germany","city":"Frankfurt am Main","website":"https://flatexdegiro.com","employees":1200,"summary":"flatexDEGIRO SE, together with its subsidiaries, provides online brokerage and IT solutions for banking and securities in Europe. The company operates through two segments, flatex and DEGIRO. The company offers online brokerage services, including execution-only securities transactions under the flatex brand; funds, saving plans, stocks, crypto, exchange-traded products, and exchange-traded funds; and services for professional traders under the ViTrade brand. It also provides securities settlement and payment transaction processing services; development and operation of securities settlement; business process outsourcing; securities-backed loans; and treasury products, such as overnight and fixed-term deposits, bank and government bonds, cash loans, and mortgage bonds, as well as undertakings for collective investment in transferable securities and special funds. In addition, the company purchases, develops, produces, distributes, and maintains software and hardware; and supplies and operates information technology infrastructure. Further, it offers Core Banking System, a platform for the technological mapping of business processes for bank operations. The company was formerly known as flatexDEGIRO AG and changed its name to flatexDEGIRO SE in December 2025. flatexDEGIRO SE was founded in 1999 and is based in Frankfurt am Main, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"flatexDEGIRO SE, avec ses filiales, fournit des solutions de courtage en ligne et des solutions informatiques pour la banque et les valeurs mobilières en Europe. La société opère à travers deux segments, flatex et DEGIRO. La société offre des services de courtage en ligne, y compris des transactions de titres d'exécution uniquement sous la marque flatex; fonds, plans d'épargne, actions, crypto, produits négociés en bourse et fonds négociés en bourse; et des services pour les traders professionnels sous la marque ViTrade."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":2390342144,"shares_outstanding":106998305,"trailing_pe":12.141304,"forward_pe":9.600963,"price_to_book":2.4525194,"ev_to_ebitda":null,"ev_to_revenue":-2.778,"dividend_yield":0.012200001,"payout_ratio":0.16299999,"beta_yahoo":1.051},"targets":{"current_price":22.34,"mean":42.41667,"median":44.0,"high":50.0,"low":31.0,"n_analysts":12,"reco_mean":2.0,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-08-14"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":184841980,"ex_dividend":"2026-06-03","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.17461,"institutions_pct":0.72813004,"institutions_float_pct":0.88216,"institutions_n":228,"institutions":[],"funds":[],"insider_trades":[]},"estimates":[{"period":"0q","end_date":"2026-12-31","eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"eps_year_ago":null,"eps_n":null,"eps_growth":null,"rev_avg":184841980,"rev_low":164183960,"rev_high":205500000,"rev_year_ago":149400000,"rev_n":2,"rev_growth":0.23719999,"eps_trend_now":null,"eps_trend_30d":null,"eps_trend_90d":null},{"period":"+1q","end_date":"2027-03-31","eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"eps_year_ago":null,"eps_n":null,"eps_growth":null,"rev_avg":175823750,"rev_low":175823750,"rev_high":175823750,"rev_year_ago":173600000,"rev_n":1,"rev_growth":0.0128,"eps_trend_now":null,"eps_trend_30d":null,"eps_trend_90d":null},{"period":"0y","end_date":"2026-12-31","eps_avg":2.08303,"eps_low":2.02586,"eps_high":2.16,"eps_year_ago":1.5,"eps_n":11,"eps_growth":0.38869998,"rev_avg":650503010,"rev_low":546000000,"rev_high":695900000,"rev_year_ago":559800000,"rev_n